          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የለም ይላል ብሎ በያዘው በሎ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታ ቀጥቅጦት ሄዷል ። ከዚህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኋላ መልአከ ውቃቢው ተገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለጸለት ማነህ አለው እኔ መ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልአከ ውቃቢህ ነኝ አለው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንኪያ እስካሁን ወዴት ኖረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃል አለው አሁንም ድል ብት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሣ ነው እንጂ ድል ባትነሣ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልገለጽልህም ነበር ብሎታል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ዘከመ ነበረ እግዚእ ኢየሱስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "በቅፍርናሆም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰሚዖ እግዚእ ኢየሱስ ከመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አኀዝዎ ለዮሐንስ ተግኅሠ ው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስተ ገሊላ ።⟫ ማር ፩ ፲፬ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ አኀዝዎ ከመ ተግኅሠ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላል ጌታችን ኢየሱስ ክርስቶ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስ ዮሐንስን እንደያዙት ዮሐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንስ እንደተያዘ በሰማ ጊዜ ገሊ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላ ገባ መከራ በመጣባችሁ ጊዜ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሽሹ ለማለት አብነት ለመሆን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኀዲጎ ለናዝሬት ወመጺኦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀደረ ቅፍርናሆም እንተ መ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንገለ ባሕር ።⟫ ናዝሬትን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትቶ በባሕር አጠገብ ባለች በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅፍርናሆም ሲያስተምር ኖረ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ውስተ አድባረ ዛብሎን ወን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍታሌም ።⟫ የዛብሎን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የንፍታሌም ዕፃ በምትሆን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ይትፈጸም ዘተብህለ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳይያስ ነቢይ ።⟫ በነቢዩ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳይያስ ቃል የተነገረው ትን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢት ይደርስ ይፈጸም ዘንድ ኖረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እንዘ ይብል ምድረ ዛብሎን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወምድረ ንፍታሌም ።⟫ ኢሳ ፱ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዛብሎን በንፍታሌም ዕፃ ያሉ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ፍኖተ ባሕር ።⟫ በባሕር አጠገብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያሉ ጰራልዩ ወጰራልያስ ። ጠጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ገጠር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ማዕዶተ ሐይቀ ዮርዳኖስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዮርዳኖስ ወደብ ማዶ በአንጻ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረ ሊባኖስ ያሉ ። ⟪ገሊላ ዘአሕዛብ⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "stage1_text": "ረ ፊባኖስ ያሉ ። ⟪ገሊላ ዘአሕዛብ⟫",
